{"id":"266856783","kind":"article","title":"睡眠中的记忆优化","author":"Piotr Wozniak","original_authors":["Piotr Wozniak"],"original_source_urls":["https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Memory_optimization_in_sleep"],"publisher":"Thoughts Memo","column":"认知基石 & 教育培训","date":"2020-10-19","updated":"2026-10-27","votes":51,"comment_count":0,"minutes":1,"chars":506,"keywords":["睡眠","记忆巩固","记忆干扰","记忆泛化","自主学习","昼夜节律"],"summary":"词条概述睡眠中的记忆优化：睡眠可能削弱、强化、重组或删除记忆，使其更持久、连贯或易于泛化；作者认为自主学习有助于形成连贯记忆，而强制学习可能造成干扰。文中概括了联合、同化和抽象三类记忆变化。","zhihu_url":"https://zhuanlan.zhihu.com/p/266856783","restoration":null,"toc":[],"html":"<p data-pid=\"2TnBKci3\">在夜晚的睡眠过程中，记忆会被削弱、强化、形成、删除或移动。这些过程有助于提高记忆的质量。记忆应该变得更简单，更持久(即不容易受到<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Interference\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">干扰</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>)，适用于更多的情况(即变得更普适)，或被遗忘(如果不是太相关)。学习、创造力和记忆优化的过程与<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Natural_creativity_cycle\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">自然创造力周期</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-2\"><a href=\"#ref-2\">[2]</a></sup>中的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Circadian_cycle\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">昼夜节律</a>相关联。</p><p data-pid=\"Le1DZbiJ\">在学习中，记忆的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Coherence\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">连贯性</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>影响着记忆如何在睡眠中得到强化。以<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Learn_drive\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">学习动力</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-4\"><a href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>为基础的<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Self-directed_learning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">自主学习</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-5\"><a href=\"#ref-5\">[5]</a></sup>是建立连贯记忆最有效的方式。与此同时，<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Coercion_in_learning\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">强制教育</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-6\"><a href=\"#ref-6\">[6]</a></sup>可能通过<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Interference\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">干扰</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-1\"><a href=\"#ref-1\">[1]</a></sup>破坏记忆，导致孤岛记忆在睡眠中被消除，或产生<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Toxic_memory\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">持久而无用、寄生或有毒的记忆</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-7\"><a href=\"#ref-7\">[7]</a></sup>。</p><p data-pid=\"OLkQkmey\"><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Sleep_leads_to_creativity,_discovery,_and_invention\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">Walker 和 Stickgold</a> 将睡眠状态下的记忆优化结果分为以下几类新的记忆：</p><ul><li data-pid=\"UDOeCzSY\"><b>联合记忆</b>：当记忆联系重新布线到新皮层(放弃海马体的中介作用)(<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Neural_optimization_in_sleep\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">记忆巩固</a>)</li><li data-pid=\"ufyIgVfm\"><b>同化记忆</b>：当语义相关的单位形成新的连接(建立<b>记忆</b><a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Coherence\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">连贯性</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-3\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>)</li><li data-pid=\"LbVidi14\"><b>抽象记忆</b>：当现有记忆被应用于更广泛的问题(<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Neural_optimization_in_sleep\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">记忆泛化</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-8\"><a href=\"#ref-8\">[8]</a></sup>)(见<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://www.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/pmc/articles/PMC2891532/figure/F1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">图</a>)</li></ul><p data-pid=\"u9IbEfVX\">抽象可以通过形成新的泛化概念来实现，也可以通过<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Forgetting\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">遗忘</a><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-9\"><a href=\"#ref-9\">[9]</a></sup><sup class=\"cite\" id=\"cite-10\"><a href=\"#ref-10\">[10]</a></sup>来雕琢已有的概念。</p><p data-pid=\"xhEG7Rei\">更多信息见：<a class=\"wrap external\" href=\"https://supermemo.guru/wiki/Neural_optimization_in_sleep\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">睡眠中的神经优化</a></p><hr/><ol class=\"references\"><li id=\"ref-1\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-1\">↩</a> 干扰 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"269974053\" href=\"#/post/269974053\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-2\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-2\">↩</a> 自然创造力周期 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"68262875\" href=\"#/post/68262875\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-3\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-3\">↩</a> 一致性与连贯性 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"264327134\" href=\"#/post/264327134\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-4\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-4\">↩</a> 学习内驱力 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"52990549\" href=\"#/post/52990549\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-5\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-5\">↩</a> 自学 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"353404375\" href=\"#/post/353404375\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-6\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-6\">↩</a> 学习中的强迫 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"351872034\" href=\"#/post/351872034\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-7\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-7\">↩</a> 毒性记忆 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"67390960\" href=\"#/post/67390960\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-8\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-8\">↩</a> 泛化与概念化 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"264989664\" href=\"#/post/264989664\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-9\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-9\">↩</a> 遗忘机制 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"265081034\" href=\"#/post/265081034\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li><li id=\"ref-10\"><a aria-label=\"返回正文\" class=\"ref-back\" href=\"#cite-10\">↩</a> 遗忘 <a class=\"tm-internal\" data-tm-id=\"558542113\" href=\"#/post/558542113\">站内阅读 ↗</a></li></ol>","rec_chain":[{"id":"266541480","title":"概念网络","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":43,"minutes":10,"reason":"同专栏上一篇 · 认知基石 & 教育培训"},{"id":"266922623","title":"语义学习","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":92,"minutes":6,"reason":"同专栏下一篇 · 认知基石 & 教育培训"},{"id":"68262875","title":"12 自然创造力周期","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":87,"minutes":24,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"52990549","title":"4 学习内驱力","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":199,"minutes":7,"reason":"本文直接引用"},{"id":"67390960","title":"9 毒性记忆","author":"Piotr Wozniak","votes":227,"minutes":24,"reason":"本文直接引用"}],"rec_bridge":[],"rec_answers":[{"id":"2334764105","title":"我们的教育是究竟为了培养(育)人还是淘汰人？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":1745,"minutes":14,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 1745 赞同","evidence":"回答含指向该译文的原生引用锚点，可唯一定位到该标题/关键词。"},{"id":"1578551193","title":"普通人怎么才会像打游戏一样爱上学习？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":1582,"minutes":77,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 1582 赞同","evidence":"正文准确提到该译文的独特标题词组，且上下文讨论的是同一记忆主题。"},{"id":"2024783376297596199","title":"如何看待“学生和家长仅仅希望高中不要凌晨五点半就到校，多睡一个小时，就被指责为想搞快乐教育”这句话？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":804,"minutes":82,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 804 赞同","evidence":"逐对核验：回答用该译文的直接脚注锚点指向文章标题或对应的特定术语。"},{"id":"3333217724","title":"学习是一件反人类的事情吗？","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":546,"minutes":90,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 546 赞同","evidence":"正文中有明确指向该译文的知乎内链/链接卡，按直接提及记为1级。"},{"id":"2497636547","title":"普通人靠努力能战胜天才吗?","author":"Thoughts Memo","votes":436,"minutes":19,"reason":"核心节选引用 · 436 赞同","evidence":"回答正文通过明确脚注标题/关键词指向该译文。"}]}